<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Dell estimates.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups Dell estimates.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates on Dell Computer Corp, citing continuing strength in the company's overall business trends.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $4.60 per share from $4.30 and 1998 estimate to $6.00 from $5.10.</p>
<p>-- Maintained near-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose two to 84-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
